  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Event on Investing in Green Energy Transition: Partnership Opportunities for Bangladesh and Europe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Team Europe Initiative green Energy Transition - TEI GET - is planning a high-level national event, to bring together partners in the green energy sector in Bangladesh on one platform. The goal is to discuss not only the impediments towards green investments and increased renewable energy generation in Bangladesh, but also evaluate potential solutions to address those as well as explore options for collaborating towards a greener Bangladesh during and after graduation from LDC.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;The overall objective of this contract is to plan, organize, manage and execute the TEI GET high-level national event.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
